BROADCAST_ACCESS
MESSAGE_ATTEMPT
DIRECT_INTERACTION
ACCOUNT_EVASION
```

The exact violation types should match the existing MaiTroll architecture.

---

# 14. Three-Strike Enforcement

Track confirmed protection-order violations.

Strike progression:

```text
Strike 1
Strike 2
Strike 3
```

After the third confirmed violation:

**14-DAY TROLL COURT DETENTION**

This is an in-app MaiTroll enforcement action.

Do not represent this as real-world law enforcement or physical arrest.

The account should be unable to use the applicable MaiTroll services for 14 days.

Record:

```text
detention_started_at
detention_expires_at
reason
related_protection_order_id
violation_count
```

After 14 days, normal account access can resume unless another active enforcement action exists.

