# 15. Protection Order Status

Create clear statuses:

```text
PENDING_HEARING
DENIED
GRANTED
ACTIVE
EXPIRED
```

Recommended behavior:

```text
PENDING_HEARING
      ↓
GRANTED
      ↓
ACTIVE
      ↓
EXPIRED
```

If denied:

```text
PENDING_HEARING
      ↓
DENIED
```

A granted order should automatically transition to EXPIRED after six months.

