# 24. Troll Coin Transaction

The Protection Order filing fee must use the existing MaiTroll Troll Coin transaction/wallet system.

Do not create a second wallet system.

The transaction should be atomic:

```text
Validate balance
      ↓
Resolve respondents
      ↓
Calculate fee
      ↓
Create court case
      ↓
Deduct Troll Coins
      ↓
Record transaction
```

If any critical step fails, the transaction must not leave the user charged without a valid filing.

Prevent duplicate submissions/double charging caused by:

* double clicks
* mobile network retries
* browser refresh
* API retries

Use an idempotent filing operation.

